@inherits LayoutComponentBase

@*
    AcceptTermsLayout — the legal-acceptance gate surface (issue #354 §5). Deliberately omits the module
    rail / nav shell so a non-compliant user cannot navigate into the app around the interstitial, and
    so the page can't re-enter MainLayout's gate check and bounce.

    Structurally the same as OnboardingLayout, and kept separate on purpose rather than shared: these are
    two independent gates that run in a fixed order (legal, then onboarding), and collapsing them into
    one layout would make either one's chrome changing a silent change to the other.
*@

<OdysseyThemeProvider></OdysseyThemeProvider>

<main id="main-content" role="main">
    @Body
</main>
